<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 320-2 IN 2ND INNS V LEEWARD ISLANDS - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 320-2 IN 2ND INNS V LEEWARD ISLANDS - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 320 for two in their second innings at lunch on the final day of their three-day tour match against the Leeward Islands on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 192-6 declared and 320-2 (R.Arnold 154 not out, M.Atapattu 118). Leeward Islands 148 (M.Muralitharan 4-34).</p>
